 "text": "Hey there! How's your day? learning trick is grouping them by starting letter, so you move through all the G words, then H words, and so on. I' double-checked it, but I believe it. Another trick is using the song five little monsters, where each monster represents a different word, G for gorilla. It' a fun absurdity, it sticks in your long term memory. How about that? We all have. The real trick is not getting stuck on word you already know. Lots of apps let you do that, and some even teach the alphabet in a fun way.",
